  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mainstreaming intersectionality as an approach to LGBT+ equality in the Commonwealth Pacific</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DFAT&#x2019;s contribution to this project enhances LGBT+ equality by advancing intersectional approaches. Alongside projects that focus on LGBT+ rights specifically, mainstreaming wider considerations around equality and non-discrimination generally can help advance the rights of LGBT+ people as well as women&#x2019;s rights, children&#x2019;s rights and the rights of people with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
